sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Client A
    participant B as Client B
    participant P as PgBouncer (transaction mode)
    participant S1 as Backend 1234

    A->>P: BEGIN
    P->>S1: A owns Backend 1234 for this transaction
    A->>P: UPDATE ...
    P->>S1: UPDATE ...
    A->>P: COMMIT
    P->>S1: COMMIT
    Note over P,S1: Backend 1234 goes back to the pool
    B->>P: SELECT ... (a transaction on its own)
    P->>S1: B owns Backend 1234 for this statement
    A->>P: SELECT ... (a transaction on its own)
    P->>S1: A gets Backend 1234 again, or any other free backend
